stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NoContact

    NoContact --> ContactAuthorized: SAGA contact policy allows
    NoContact --> Denied: contact_not_authorized

    ContactAuthorized --> DataRequestSubmitted: requester sends data access request

    DataRequestSubmitted --> PolicyDenied: no matching Data Sharing Policy
    DataRequestSubmitted --> PolicyDenied: data_class_denied
    DataRequestSubmitted --> PolicyDenied: purpose_mismatch
    DataRequestSubmitted --> PolicyDenied: version_out_of_bounds
    DataRequestSubmitted --> PolicyAllowed: policy_match

    PolicyAllowed --> DataTokenIssued: bind owner/requester/record/purpose/version/max_uses
    DataTokenIssued --> TransformDenied: token_expired
    DataTokenIssued --> TransformDenied: token_exhausted
    DataTokenIssued --> TransformDenied: requester_mismatch
    DataTokenIssued --> TransformDenied: requester_key_mismatch
    DataTokenIssued --> TransformReady: token_valid

    TransformReady --> ReEncrypted: PRE transform EDEK_o to EDEK_r
    ReEncrypted --> AuditAllow: write allow audit event
    AuditAllow --> Delivered: return EDEK_r and ciphertext_ref
    Delivered --> [*]

    PolicyDenied --> AuditDeny: write deny audit event
    TransformDenied --> AuditDeny: write deny audit event
    AuditDeny --> Denied
    Denied --> [*]
